; Rowland--Taylor van der Waals radii used by the Martini 3 small-molecule
; parametrization workflow. Values are in nm.
;
; Reference: Rowland, R. S.; Taylor, R. Intermolecular Nonbonded Contact
; Distances in Organic Crystal Structures: Comparison with Distances Expected
; from van der Waals Radii. J. Phys. Chem. 1996, 100, 7384-7391.
; DOI: 10.1021/jp953141+
;
; This is an element table consumed by Swarm-CG. Each run generates exact
; residue/atom entries in a local GROMACS vdwradii.dat file.
H   0.110
C   0.177
N   0.164
O   0.158
F   0.146
S   0.181
Cl  0.176
Br  0.187
I   0.203
